基于Hive的农产品质量追溯系统的设计与实现

摘　要
农产品质量安全关乎消费者健康、农业产业发展及社会稳定，构建全程可追溯体系是行业必然需求。当前农产品追溯存在数据分散、存储有限、查询低效等问题，难以满足全产业链管控需求。结合大数据技术优势，设计开发基于Hive的农产品质量追溯系统，整合种植、加工、物流、销售全环节数据，采用Docker容器化部署保障环境一致性，通过Spark实现数据高效处理，依托Flask构建Web交互界面。阐述系统相关技术与发展现状，分析可行性与功能需求，完成架构、流程、数据库及模块设计，重点实现核心功能模块并开展测试，最后探讨系统优化方向。系统实现了农产品质量全程追溯与数据可视化分析，为消费者、企业及监管部门提供便捷服务，具有实际应用价值。
关键词：
农产品质量追溯；Hive数据仓库；Docker容器化；Spark；B/S架构
Research and Implementation of Agricultural Product Quality Traceability System Based on Hive
ABSTRACT
The quality and safety of agricultural products are related to consumers' health, agricultural industry development and social stability. Building a full-process traceability system is an inevitable demand of the industry. Currently, agricultural product traceability faces problems such as scattered data, limited storage and low query efficiency, which are difficult to meet the needs of the entire industrial chain management and control. Combining the advantages of big data technology, this study designs and develops an agricultural product quality traceability system based on Hive, integrating data from the whole links of planting, processing, logistics and sales, adopting Docker containerization deployment to ensure environmental consistency, realizing efficient data processing through Spark, and building a Web interactive interface relying on Flask. This paper expounds the relevant technologies and development status of the system, analyzes the feasibility and functional requirements, completes the design of architecture, process, database and modules, focuses on realizing the core functional modules and carrying out tests, and finally discusses the optimization direction of the system. The system realizes the whole-process traceability of agricultural product quality and data visualization analysis, provides convenient services for consumers, enterprises and regulatory authorities, and has practical application value.
